---
import AboutHeroImage from "../assets/me.jpeg";
import CommitHistory from "../components/CommitHistory.astro";
import Layout from "../layouts/BlogPost.astro";

const workExperienceStartingDate = new Date(2021, 1, 3);
const currentDate = Date.now();
const timeDiff = currentDate - workExperienceStartingDate.getTime();
const workExperienceInYears = Math.round(
	timeDiff / (1000 * 60 * 60 * 24) / 365,
);
---

<Layout
	title="About Me"
	description="I'd rather not share"
	pubDate={new Date("July 25 2026")}
	heroImage={AboutHeroImage}
>
	<p>
		I am a developer who enjoys running, programming, reading and good
		coffee. Topics in am interested in are: privacy, security and
		programming. I graduated with a bachelors degree in Information and
		Communication Technology from the Ede Christian University of Applied
		Sciences.
	</p>
	<p>
		My journey as a developer started in elementary school when I took a
		course in plain HTML. Later I tought myself Python by downloading public
		domain datasets and analyzing them with Pandas and Numpy. I worked at a
		startup as full-stack Laravel developer with a focus on back-end and
		quality control. After that I worked as a software tester for a company
		developing workforce management software. Right now I work as a
		full-stack Java/Vue developer for the same company.
	</p>
	<p>
		Below is an overview of my {workExperienceInYears} years of work experience:
	</p>
	<table>
		<tr>
			<th>Company</th>
			<th>Role</th>
			<th>Employment type</th>
			<th>Start date</th>
		</tr>
		<tr>
			<td>Intus Workforce Solutions</td>
			<td>Java Developer</td>
			<td>Full Time</td>
			<td>Nov 01, 2025</td>
		</tr>
		<tr>
			<td>Intus Workforce Solutions</td>
			<td>Software Tester</td>
			<td>Full Time</td>
			<td>Sep 01, 2024</td>
		</tr>
		<tr>
			<td>Nederlandse Voedsel- en Warenautoriteit</td>
			<td>Software Developer</td>
			<td>Internship</td>
			<td>Feb 01, 2024</td>
		</tr>
		<tr>
			<td>Intus Workforce Solutions</td>
			<td>Software Developer</td>
			<td>Internship</td>
			<td>Sep 01, 2023</td>
		</tr>
		<tr>
			<td>Q2-software</td>
			<td>Laravel Developer</td>
			<td>Part Time</td>
			<td>Jul 01, 2022</td>
		</tr>
		<tr>
			<td>Cellro | CNC Automation</td>
			<td>Software Developer</td>
			<td>Internship</td>
			<td>Mar 01, 2022</td>
		</tr>
		<tr>
			<td>Educator</td>
			<td>Support Engineer</td>
			<td>Part Time</td>
			<td>Feb 03, 2021</td>
		</tr>
	</table>
</Layout>
